f Resonance Skill Overshock is cast by {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tapping PC=pressing Gamepad=pressing} the button, clear all Electric Surge to grant Resonators in the team {1}% ATK Bonus for {2}s.\nIf Resonance Skill Overshock is cast by holding down the button, consume {3} {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=3} of Concerto Energy to deal damage, then clear all Electric Surge to enter Apex Resonance.\n\nApex Resonance\nWhile in Apex Resonance, Resonance Skill Thrum of All Sounds is unlocked, which consumes {4}% Thunder Rage per second:\nWhile on the ground, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} Resonance Skill to launch up to {5} consecutive attacks:\n- The first {6} {Cus:Sap,S=stage P=stages SapTag=5}: Thrum of All Sounds: Spectro, dealing Spectro DMG.\n- The next {7} {Cus:Sap,S=stage P=stages SapTag=6}: Thrum of All Sounds: Havoc, dealing Havoc DMG.\n- The last {8} {Cus:Sap,S=stage P=stages SapTag=7}: Thrum of All Sounds: Silencing Blade, dealing Aero DMG.\nWhile on the ground, hold Resonance Skill to cast Thrum of All Sounds: Aero, dealing Aero DMG and leaping into the air.\nWhile airborne, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} Resonance Skill to perform up to {9} stages of Mid-air Attacks:\n- The first {10} {Cus:Sap,S=stage P=stages SapTag=9}: Thrum of All Sounds: Havoc Mid-air Attack, dealing Havoc DMG.\n- The next {11} {Cus:Sap,S=stage P=stages SapTag=A}: Thrum of All Sounds: Aero Mid-air Attack, dealing Aero DMG and healing all nearby Resonators in the team.\n- The last {12} {Cus:Sap,S=stage P=stages SapTag=B}: Thrum of All Sounds: Aero Plunging Attack, dealing Aero DMG. {Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} Resonance Skill shortly after landing to cast Thrum of All Sounds: Silencing Blade.\nHold Resonance Skill in mid-air to cast Thrum of All Sounds: Aero Plunging Attack.\nEach time Thrum of All Sounds hits the target, Thunder Bane is triggered, dealing Electro DMG to the target within range, considered Resonance Skill DMG.\nWhile in Apex Resonance, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} Resonance Skill shortly after casting a Basic Attack to chain into a specific Thrum of All Sounds skill based on the different Basic Attack Stages.\n\nElectric Surge\nRover can hold up to {13} points of Electric Surge.\nElectric Surge is restored when Intro Skill - Thunderous Fury, Normal Attack - Deterrence, Resonance Skill - Thunderclap, or Basic Attack - Repel deals damage.\n\nThunder Rage\nRover can hold up to {14} points of Thunder Rage.\nEntering Apex Resonance restores Thunder Rage to the max limit.\nThunder Rage is restored when Thrum of All Sounds deals damage.","rows":[{"name":"Overshock DMG","mult":[{"kind":"pct","hits":[[40.6,7],[213.15,1],[213.15,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[43.93,7],[230.63,1],[230.63,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[47.26,7],[248.11,1],[248.11,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[51.92,7],[272.58,1],[272.58,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[55.25,7],[290.06,1],[290.06,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[59.08,7],[310.16,1],[310.16,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[64.41,7],[338.12,1],[338.12,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[69.74,7],[366.09,1],[366.09,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[75.06,7],[394.06,1],[394.06,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[80.72,7],[423.77,1],[423.77,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[87.38,7],[458.73,1],[458.73,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[94.04,7],[493.68,1],[493.68,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[100.7,7],[528.64,1],[528.64,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[107.36,7],[563.59,1],[563.59,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[114.01,7],[598.55,1],[598.55,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[120.67,7],[633.51,1],[633.51,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[127.33,7],[668.46,1],[668.46,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[133.99,7],[703.42,1],[703.42,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[140.65,7],[738.38,1],[738.38,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[147.31,7],[773.33,1],[773.33,1]]}],"extra":[]},{"name":"Thrum of All Sounds: Spectro Stage 1 DMG","mult":[{"kind":"pct","hits":[[49.86,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[53.95,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[58.04,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[63.76,1]]},{"kind":"pct